<title>SWEDEN: Incentive bids for Vivra.</title>
<headline>Incentive bids for Vivra.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment company Incentive AB said on Monday it had signed an agreement with U.S. group Vivra Incorporated to merge Vivra's Renal Care business with its wholly-owned Gambro medical technology unit.</p>
<p>Incentive said in a statement that according to the agreement it would acquire all of the outstanding shares of Vivra common stock for $35.62 per share or a total cash consideration of $1.59 billion.</p>
</text>
